[Test-planner execution]
Load the test-planner                         - . ./tools/test-planner/load-test-planner
Run end-to-end                                - test-planner run --file specs/test-planner-plans/sim/sparta/perf-valid/pacific_sn1.yaml -o pacific_sn1.json
Run end-to-end with --delete-on-pass          - test-planner run --delete-on-pass --file specs/test-planner-plans/sim/sparta/perf-valid/pacific_sn1.yaml -o pacific_sn1.json
Run in 2 phases                               - test-planner run --wake-build-option=--dry-run --file specs/test-planner-plans/sim/sparta/perf-valid/pacific_sn1.yaml -o pacific_sn1.json
                                              - wake -v build plan.json
Run in 2 phases locally                       - test-planner run --wake-build-option=--dry-run --local --file specs/test-planner-plans/sim/sparta/perf-valid/pacific_sn1.yaml -o pacific_sn1.json
                                              - wake -v build plan.json

